{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "7bb37d2a-709c-8bb6-a576-afe09886b8f7",
  "created_at": "2026-02-09T10:18:50-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Recreation",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Lucille Santoro",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Beth Almeida",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:16:13-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Recreation Department, this is Beth, good morning!"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:16:16-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, good morning Beth. This is Lucille Santoro. I am calling because a class my son signed up for was cancelled, and I would like to get a refund, please."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:16:28-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, sure, I can help with that. Which class was it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:16:33-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It was the winter [inaudible] basketball clinic, on Saturday mornings. They sent an email last week, it said cancelled, not enough kids."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:16:42-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, the Saturday clinic. I'm sorry, you broke up a little there. Did you say your son's name or yours that it was registered under?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:16:52-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Registered under me, Santoro. S-A-N-T-O-R-O. Lucille."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:16:55-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Let me pull that up. [pause] Yep, I see it. It shows cancelled, so the refund goes back to the card you paid with. It usually takes a little while to show up on the statement."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:17:09-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A little while, what does that mean, like days? Or weeks?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:17:14-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "More like a couple of weeks, to be safe. Banks are different, so if it's not there by then, call me back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:17:23-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, okay, that is fine. Thank you. Oh, and I want to ask also, what are the age limits for the programs? My son is eleven, but my daughter is just seven, and I would like something for her."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:17:38-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It depends on the program. Most of the youth ones are grouped by age, like six to eight, nine to twelve, that kind of thing. What does she like to do?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:17:50-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "She likes to [line breaks up] dance, and the art, she draws everything."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:17:55-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, you cut out. Dance and art? Those both usually have a younger group. I can email you the spring list when it's ready, or you can check the recreation page."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:18:07-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, the list please, that is perfect. I will give you the email next time, I am in the car and the signal is bad."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:18:17-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem at all. Are you driving right now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:18:21-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, but parked, don't worry! Actually I am practicing the road. Tonight is my daughter's school concert, and I want to rehearse the drive so I am not late, with the parking and everything."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:18:34-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's so sweet. Good idea, too, parking can be a headache. I hope she has a wonderful night!"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:18:42-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Beth! You were very helpful. Have a good day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:18:47-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Lucille. Bye now!"
    }
  ],
